### Get all medicines

GET http://localhost:5027/api/medicines

### Get medicine by id

GET http://localhost:5027/api/medicines/99999999

### Create medicine

POST http://localhost:5027/api/medicines
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Burana 400 mg",
    "activeIngredient": "ibuprofeeni"
}

### Update medicine

PUT http://localhost:5027/api/medicines/5
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Burana 400 mg tabletti",
    "activeIngredient": "ibuprofeeni"
}

### Delete medicine
DELETE http://localhost:5027/api/medicines/6


### Get medicine by name
GET http://localhost:5027/api/medicines/search?query=panadol


### Ensimmäinen sivu
GET http://localhost:5027/api/medicines/search?query=burana&page=1&pageSize=5

### Toinen sivu
GET http://localhost:5027/api/medicines/search?query=burana&page=2

### Liian suuri pageSize
GET http://localhost:5027/api/medicines/search?query=burana&page=1&pageSize=101

### Virheellinen sivunumero
GET http://localhost:5027/api/medicines/search?query=burana&page=0&pageSize=10